contentText:
Following Megan Thee Stallion and Klay Thompson&#8217;s breakup, The Sims is helping the rapper say &#8220;dag dag&#8221; &#8212; which means &#8220;goodbye&#8221; in Simlish &#8212; to the NBA star.

